# ==========================================
# DocMind API — REST Client
# ==========================================
# 使用说明:
# 1. 安装 VS Code 插件: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
# 2. 点击请求上方的 "Send Request" 链接即可发送
# 3. 快捷键: Cmd+Alt+R (macOS) / Ctrl+Alt+R (Windows/Linux)
# 4. 每个请求之间用 "###" 分隔
# ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatInput": "你好，请介绍一下这个知识库的内容"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatInput": "产品有哪些功能？",
  "sessionId": "user-123"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatInput": "刚才说的第一个功能，能详细说说吗？",
  "sessionId": "user-123"
}

